<title>UK: NYNEX Corp signs $1.0 bln EMTN programme.</title>
<headline>NYNEX Corp signs $1.0 bln EMTN programme.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>NYNEX Corp has signed a $1.0 billion Euro medium-term note (EMTN) programme, arranger Lehman Brothers said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>NYNEX Capital Funding Company will issue notes guaranteed by NYNEX Corporation and the notes will be rated A3 by Moody's Investors Service and A-minus by Standard &amp; Poor's.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7970</p>
</text>
